            <div xml:id="d794">

                <pb facs="0852" n="754" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg754"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/123</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Russian Chargé</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Ughet</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic">March 21,
                        1919</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Polk</hi>: I have the honor to enclose
                    herewith a memorandum relative to certain acts of the Chinese Government
                    prejudicial to Russian interests and it seems of great importance to Russia that
                    some action be taken by the Allied and Associated powers to call to the
                    attention of the Chinese Government the inadmissibility of one-sided violation
                    of the existing treaties with Russia. The principles set forth in this
                    memorandum have been submitted to the Governments of France, Great Britain and
                    Japan.</p>
                <p>I avail myself [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. Ughet</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d794-a1.xml" xpointer="d794-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
